cff-version: 1.2.0
message: 'If you use JustFig in your research, please cite it as below.'
type: software
title: 'JustFig'
abstract: 'Free, open-source scientific figure editor for wet-lab biologists, in the browser: shapes, arrows that stay attached, rich text with sub- and superscripts, a library of openly licensed scientific icons with recolouring and automatic attribution, procedural objects (well plates, membranes, DNA, plasmid maps, gels, cells), colourblind-safe palettes, templates, and export to SVG, PDF, PNG and TIFF at journal sizes. Figures never leave the computer.'
authors:
